#Задача_define_architecture_snapshot_v1<[
Базис:
  Architecture graph должен быть derived projection, rebuildable из .bvc, intent tree, memory и trace links.
  UI, PVRG slice и dashboard оператора не должны парсить raw .bvc в браузере для architecture map.
Вектор:
  Определить architecture.snapshot.v1 JSON schema: blocks, containers, artifacts, edges, counts, focusBlockId, source refs.
  Зафиксировать deterministic builder input: charter, intent/index.bvc, workgraph.snapshot.v1, trace links validator output, опционально memory/evidence exports.
  Описать stable ids для blocks/containers и typed edges compatible with derived graph viewer contracts.
Цель:
  Architecture map и block detail panel читают один rebuildable snapshot contract, а не ad-hoc HTML data.

